  /* Trill's 18s clock, in seconds: Alex tapbacks the sent bubble at 0.6 and
     his reply lands at 1.2 — the sidebar preview and timestamp follow on the
     same frame. The composer focuses at 1.75, types 15 chars by 3.15, and ↑
     sends at 3.4: the bubble pops with a five-second undo pill that yields
     to Delivered at 5.0. ⇧⌘F at 5.4 drops global search over the thread —
     "from:alex" is typed by 6.8 and three matches snap in mid-word; then
     " has:link" lands by 7.6 and the list refines to link rows on the same
     frame; ↵ blips the selection at 8.8, closed by 9.7. ⇧⌘R at 9.9 swaps
     the sidebar to needs-reply — Alex is absent, you just answered him —
     and Mom's thread snoozes at 11.6, ticking the count 3 → 2; restored by
     13.1. ⌘⇧L at 13.5 opens the Library over the thread: shared images,
     links, and files bloom in a grid, one link blips at 15.7, gone by 16.6.
     The thread's additions fade out around 17.5 so the loop seam lands on
     the plain thread, invisible. */
  @keyframes tapback-pops {
    0%, 3.5% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.4);
    }
    4.4% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1.16);
    }
    5.2%, 96.8% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    98.6%, 100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
